commit ed4a5553df363039d9e20f53bdd0d84e26da3c68
Author: Keith Ballinger <keithballinger@google.com>
Date:   Thu Jul 3 03:43:12 2025 -0700

    feat(hud): implement tool approval mode with UI prompts
    
    - Add support for tool approval requests in IPC server
    - Create approval UI with approve/reject buttons in ToolExecutionView
    - Handle tool.approval events to show pending tools in HUD
    - Update approve/reject methods to properly update tool states
    - Connect approval decisions back to CLI via IPC
    - Tool approvals now work correctly in ask mode

commit b76978a2cc224e275b804aa7c5701a43c712e51e
Author: Keith Ballinger <keithballinger@google.com>
Date:   Thu Jul 3 03:35:18 2025 -0700

    fix(hud): fix tool execution display flow to show tools inline
    
    - Change tool.start handling to add tools to current message instead of creating new message
    - Update tool.end to not clear currentStreamMessage, allowing post-tool content to continue
    - Add logic in ConversationView to show content before/after tools based on execution state
    - Tools now appear inline where they execute rather than at the end of responses
    - Fix visual flow so tool outputs are properly integrated into the conversation
, "success": 1, "name": run_shell_command]
